置计划性常规剂量调整；若出现严重心动过缓或重度淋巴细胞减少按方案规定执行安全中断或永久停药。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：V2首剂6小时心电与生命体征监测、心率血压动态监测及心动过缓发生率作为安全性终点、有症状心动过缓及房室传导阻滞列为AESI、心脏疾病为排除标准、固定剂量设计无计划性剂量调整。未确认事项：V3至V10各访视是否包含生命体征测量及体格检查、具体测量参数（体温、呼吸频率、体重等）、测量频率与异常处理阈值、体格检查的项目范围与执行频率。需医学经理结合IB及既往S1P类药物临床数据确认完整监测方案。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_97189da36a75_61f0b45ee0bd2b30","section_number":"7.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:afd3b3583c748fbe6875bd0c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260923223939_067b0407","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:revision:7","quote":"12导联心电图PR间期与房室传导阻滞监测","quote_sha256":"807d868a7660c6aac02f5e49cf0d23c8e32492962041733cdf3dc47f0befdad6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe","span_id":"es_ecg_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:revision:7","quote":"首剂V2完成6小时心电与生命体征监测","quote_sha256":"0aaab0850e4b1b609f66e64aa52099a23bda9f095f165e30b14a5f35181a38a9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe","span_id":"es_ecg_6h"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:revision:7","quote":"有症状的心动过缓或二度/三度房室传导阻滞","quote_sha256":"248c0a0831d81495d18bd0784c4c94836ea49ad9fa9a97edb15e828e312a713f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe","span_id":"es_ecg_aesI"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:revision:7","quote":"存在严重心律失常、二度或三度房室传导阻滞、病态窦房结综合征","quote_sha256":"0ecb13ca002129fb60662dcf7c27c64e26d7d6f58155ac429b5bc0b39cbc8a86","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe","span_id":"es_vitals_exclusion"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_ecg_endpoint","es_ecg_6h","es_ecg_aesI","es_vitals_exclusion"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"需从IB或既往同类药物方案中获取心电图监测时点安排","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ecg_schedule","missing_source_classes":["Investigator's Brochure","既往S1P受体调节剂临床研究方案"],"target":"7.3.2节中除V2外各访视心电图采集时点与频率"},{"action":"需确认PR间期延长标准、新发AVB分级及对应处理措施","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ecg_threshold","missing_source_classes":["Investigator's Brochure","安全性管理计划"],"target":"7.3.2节中PR间期延长及房室传导阻滞的判定阈值与处理"}],"heading":"心电图检查","missing_source_classes":["Investigator's Brochure","既往S1P受体调节剂临床研究方案","心电图操作与判读手册"],"proposal_text":"本研究安全性终点包含12导联心电图PR间期与房室传导阻滞监测。首剂给药访视（V2，第1天）完成6小时心电与生命体征监测，其中包含连续心电监测以观察首次口服合成药M8后的心电传导变化。有症状的心动过缓或二度/三度房室传导阻滞列为特别关注的不良事件。筛选期存在严重心律失常、二度或三度房室传导阻滞、病态窦房结综合征的受试者不得入组。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：12导联心电图PR间期与房室传导阻滞监测列为安全性终点、V2首剂6小时心电监测、二度/三度房室传导阻滞为AESI、心脏传导疾病为排除标准。未确认事项：除V2外其他访视（V3至V10）是否进行12导联心电图、心电图采集的具体时点与频率、PR间期延长或新发房室传导阻滞的判定阈值与处理流程。需医学经理结合IB及既往S1P类药物临床数据确认完整心电图监测方案。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_97189da36a75_1f21c25c855b08a5","section_number":"7.3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:afd3b3583c748fbe6875bd0c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260923223939_067b0407","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:revision:7","quote":"外周血绝对淋巴细胞计数（ALC）变化","quote_sha256":"3716d5555d8c370472500e0489308fe2c737f7943543468f9d8c6330ca2b28fc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe","span_id":"es_lab_alc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:revision:7","quote":"重度淋巴细胞减少（ALC < 0.2×10^9/L）；转氨酶显著升高（ALT/AST > 5×ULN）","quote_sha256":"bb394802339dee93cf7d0634bb634b33664fd5f11bce041275c0d7cd55bff850","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe","span_id":"es_lab_aesI"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:revision:7","quote":"严重肝肾功能不全（ALT/AST > 3倍ULN，血肌酐 > 1.5倍ULN）","quote_sha256":"a8025ef3cd2979c9e71092b5adfdd1c2604c5031419ed3f80a425f10d28cf8e8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe","span_id":"es_lab_exclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:revision:7","quote":"本研究为固定剂量双盲治疗设计，不设置计划性常规剂量调整；若出现严重心动过缓或重度淋巴细胞减少按方案规定执行安全中断或永久停药","quote_sha256":"df2c1e2cfb69f296365fbef3a963ee4c0bcbffd6deeed7776912a1c9caeb189f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe","span_id":"es_dose_adjust"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_lab_alc","es_lab_aesI","es_lab_exclusion","es_dose_adjust"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"需从IB或既往同类药物方案中获取实验室检查项目范围","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_lab_panel","missing_source_classes":["Investigator's Brochure","既往S1P受体调节剂临床研究方案"],"target":"7.3.3节中实验室检查完整项目清单"},{"action":"需确认ALC、肝肾功能等指标在各访视的采集安排","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_lab_frequency","missing_source_classes":["Investigator's Brochure","安全性评估操作手册"],"target":"7.3.3节中各访视实验室检查采集频率与时点"},{"action":"需确认ALC < 0.2×10^9/L及ALT/AST > 5×ULN以外的其他干预阈值","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_lab_threshold","missing_source_classes":["Investigator's Brochure","安全性管理计划"],"target":"7.3.3节中实验室异常值处理与永久停药阈值"}],"heading":"实验室检查","missing_source_classes":["Investigator's Brochure","既往S1P受体调节剂临床研究方案","实验室检查操作手册"],"proposal_text":"本研究安全性终点包含外周血绝对淋巴细胞计数（ALC）变化。特别关注的不良事件包括重度淋巴细胞减少（ALC < 0.2×10^9/L）和转氨酶显著升高（ALT/AST > 5×ULN）。筛选期存在严重肝肾功能不全（ALT/AST > 3倍ULN，血肌酐 > 1.5倍ULN）的受试者不得入组。本研究为固定剂量双盲治疗设计，不设置计划性常规剂量调整；若出现严重心动过缓或重度淋巴细胞减少按方案规定执行安全中断或永久停药。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：ALC变化列为安全性终点、重度淋巴细胞减少（ALC < 0.2×10^9/L）及转氨酶显著升高（ALT/AST > 5×ULN）为AESI、严重肝肾功能不全为排除标准、固定剂量设计无计划性剂量调整。未确认事项：实验室检查完整项目清单（血常规分类、肝肾功能全套、尿常规、凝血功能、免疫球蛋白等）、各访视采集频率、ALC及转氨酶监测的具体时点、异常值处理与永久停药阈值。需医学经理结合IB及既往S1P类药物临床数据确认完整实验室监测方案。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_97189da36a75_2ffdc7581fa87d69","section_number":"7.3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:afd3b3583c748fbe6875bd0c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260923223939_067b0407","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"需从IB或项目安全性管理文件中获取妊娠检查安排","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_preg_method","missing_source_classes":["Investigator's Brochure","妊娠安全性数据"],"target":"7.3.4节中妊娠检查方法、时点与阳性处理流程"},{"action":"需确认是否要求避孕、避孕方式及问询时点","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_contraception","missing_source_classes":["避孕方法指导文件","项目安全性管理计划"],"target":"7.3.4节中避孕方法要求与避孕问询内容"},{"action":"需确认妊娠报告时限、报告对象及新生儿随访方案","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_preg_report","missing_source_classes":["妊娠报告与随访流程文件"],"target":"7.3.4节中妊娠报告流程与新生儿随访安排"}],"heading":"妊娠检查和避孕问询","missing_source_classes":["Investigator's Brochure","妊娠安全性数据","避孕方法指导文件","妊娠报告与随访流程文件"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"允许来源中未包含妊娠检查方法、避孕方式要求、妊娠报告流程、哺乳期排除条款或避孕问询时点的任何直接表述。研究人群限定为18至55岁成人，但未明确是否排除妊娠或哺乳期女性，亦未给出避孕问询的具体内容与时点。由研究人群年龄范围不能推出避孕方法、伴侣妊娠报告、新生儿随访或妊娠检查日程。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_97189da36a75_1a68dab2b3442f32","section_number":"7.3.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:afd3b3583c748fbe6875bd0c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_52648d82de1f5b1add03:r7:13b90e8dcf1462fe"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"9a2bf8b11085398a07e5bf449b